<h2>Appointment Updated by Patient</h2>

<p>Dear <strong><%= @appointment.doctor.full_name %></strong>,</p>

<p>The patient <strong><%= @appointment.patient.full_name %></strong> has updated your appointment. Please find the updated details below:</p>

<hr class="my-2">

<p>
  <strong>Doctor:</strong> <%= @appointment.doctor.full_name %> (<%= @appointment.doctor.specialization %>)<br>
  <strong>Patient:</strong> <%= @appointment.patient.full_name %><br>
  <strong>Date:</strong> <%= @appointment.appointment_date.strftime("%A, %d %B %Y") %><br>
  <strong>Time:</strong> 
  <% if @appointment.slot %>
    <%= @appointment.slot.start_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %>
    <% if @appointment.slot.end_time.present? %>
      - <%= @appointment.slot.end_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %>
    <% end %>
  <% else %>
    Not assigned
  <% end %><br>
  <strong>Status:</strong> <%= @appointment.status.titleize %>
</p>

<% if @appointment.reason.present? %>
  <p><strong>Reason for Appointment:</strong> <%= @appointment.reason %></p>
<% else %>
  <p><strong>Reason for Appointment:</strong> Not provided</p>
<% end %>

<p>Please make sure to review this update. If you need to contact the patient for any changes or confirmations, please do so promptly.</p>

<p>Thank you for your attention and continued care.</p>

<hr class="my-2">

<p><em>This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.</em></p>
